<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Kholosithek</para>
  <para style="toc1">KHOLOSITHEK shii Phaul re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kholosithek</para>
  <para style="toc3">Khol</para>
  <para style="mt1">KHOLOSITHEK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yao phi</para>
  <para style="ip">Phaul ro jigigam Kholosithek shii zey pha ji ne Iphisus pha bichiu Asia Minor pha du-ùa Kholosi charch shii zeyjong ro. Ji pha charch ne Phaul è rung pha asi ro, jishii ji pha sohthua ne Phaul è airo gaja rone than, ji è ai è Roman iliing pha soh Asia rajan pha Iphisus è bliapho thoh ge. Phaul è yoi shii Kholosi pha charch shii ne biidiie pha masdothek um hanyie è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii thieg pha nane ley giawo um pha khalo shii ne luruak khohphothek nane riichaithek jia shii sia bie chid phro ne yua ramuii. Ji pha rog shii, ji pha masdothek è yao. Migiangkheg ne michiethek chiang shii nane gai miyaothek shii ne wie è nuii ne gang è bokhoh chid.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ji pha muyuathek shii suang rek pha Phaul è izai masiphothek mua ji è zey. Airo muchang ji è Isu Masi ne ley giawo phi mua chiih-è ji pha gai migithek nane dabthek ai è ruang noh muii phro. Masi chiang Hamangkhung-aphuii è sohjambling shii zen, ai chiang è ji shii iidoh yie din. Sohjambling giawo luthong ne Masi shii ò pha ji è ro. Chiihphado Phaul è migiphothek pha chaithek shii ji pha boh muyuathek shii lua ne zey phi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hì ne Thychikhus shii isiie rek chid, hanyie yi hì pha jigigam Phaul chiang shii Kholosi hà yie phi shii Onesimus de ò shii um, Philimon ro khiao chiang shii Phaul è philimon shii zey.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ziig nane Masi ro blia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 1:9">1:9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:19">2:19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi shii iwo chai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 2:20">2:20</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:6">4:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jongsha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Phaul re-è, hanyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii miiyang ne Masi Isu ro guaphasamoy ji nane gethek ro khuiino Thimothi—<verse eid="COL 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bran Kholosi pha, hanyie yi gathek ro migi ijakthek Masi rog shii:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Gathek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii bushun nane liijiing phi bo.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laso pha misia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Gathek è nathek shii sia shii, gathek ne idang gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi Aphuii pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Chiih-è gathek ne nathek ro migi Masi Isu shii nane nathek ro miie ne zab Hamangkhung-aphuii bran shii um ro ji de yoi muii ro. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Zai mua nyie yi Mua Wie ji igobi nathek shii thog, ai è zid pha luthong chiang ne nathek è yoi. Ji è nathek ro migi nane miie yi hamangkhung hà ragia rek ne ruii phi pha luthong shii rai ro. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Chiih-è hìne nathek duchoi shii, nathek ne igobi pha inai è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun chiang shii yoi chiih-è hìne nyie khi-èrek pha izai rone thieg pha duiine mua ne khirzey yie ne chiih-è zab pha sohjambling shii shiiy lumao muii ro. <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Khol 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Phlm 23</ref></char></note>Nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne, hanyie yi gathek <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gethek ro; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigi shuii ne um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nathek.</char></note>duchoi pha Masi ro isiie bliapho Ephaphras, gathek ro ijak khiao ji è thieg ro. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Ai è gathek shii Ragung è nathek shii phi pha miie ji yao phi ro.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Chiih-è ji pha chiang è gathek ne nathek chiang yoi pha ji è yie ne idang nathek shii sia phi, gathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii sia, nathek shii de airo Ragung phi pha awailum pha khani, gao nane khani ji zan phi bo. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Chiihphado nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è chid pha duiine rai mua, chiih-è nathek ne ai nyie sang pha wie blia ji idang rek mua. Nathek chai shii de zab pha wie blia è se ruii, chiih-è nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro khani è sieng ruii. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="COL 1:11-12"/>Nathek ne nyie airo biisiie boh blu è thog pha chuh pha rog shii gang ji rek phi, ji è nathek ne lubuphiang pha rog shii zab zud mua. Chiih-è lubo rog shii Aphuii shii laso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11-12: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jum rog chiih-è lubo rog shii laso phi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jum nane lubo rog shii chiih-è laso phi.</char></note> phi mua ruii phro. Hanyie shii nawairo mathang mua spho rek phi pha ji shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è awai branthek ro nyie shii isang pha Sajathua hà ong ne ruii phi ro. <verse eid="COL 1:11-12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Ai è gethek shii riichai igiia è ragia rek phi srane Sajathua pha awairo bushun Dufuii hà noh ne ragia rek phi, <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Iphi 1:7</ref></char></note>hanyie è gethek ro layogthek khung phi srane ichad rek phi.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isu Masi nane airo blia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Masi ne adoh pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii doh pha mia ro. Ai ne igobi giak pha Dufuii ro, chiih-è nyie manathek rab pha ji shii zab è bo ro. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Ai chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii è hamangkhung nane sohnyiak shii zab rab. Chiih-è doh pha mana de rab chiih-è adoh pha manathek de rab, Chiih-è luruak pha blu è yi ne, ithongthek, khophothek chiih-è riichaithek de rab. Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab hamangnyiak shii rab chiih-è ai re-è ai pha rab phi. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Zab è ibi Masi ne um, chiih-è ai rog shii dog ne zab pha mana ne airo awai ithua shii um ro. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22">Iphi 1:22</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 1:23">23</ref></char></note>Ai ne siu pha khrug charch ro; Ai ne siu pha chai ithua ro. Ai ne igobi giak pha Dufuii ro, nyieliieshii ai ne zab pha manathek è de ibi rai mua pha ai ne iy bsa è de hòi din. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Chiih-è hì ne Hamangkhung-aphuii awai muphak pha ji è Dufuii ne awailum ne Hamankhung-aphuii duiine rey ro. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Iphi 2:16</ref></char></note>Dufuii chiang è, chiihphado Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab hamangnyiak shii awai hàne iidoh yie din pha phak. Hamangkhung-aphuii è bai pha awai dufuii ro ifai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ai Dufuii ro ifai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ai Dufuii ne iy bsa à zid muii ro.</char></note> ji è zab shii liijiing rab phi, chiih-è zab pha manathek shii chiih-è nyie shii sohnyiak nane hamangkhung shii de ai chiang è iidoh awai hà yie din yi.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Luang jia shii nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è ruang rey ne chiih-è nyieliieshii nathek è awie pha blia rek ne now pha chiang aishii suangthek rek. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Jishii thuh ne, airo dufuii iy pha chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii airo ijak rab phi srane So igang, nane biidiie asi bsa è ai moe hà noh phi. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Na ne athothang pha gang shii isiie rek ne chiih-è chuh rek ne rai bo, chiih-è na mua yoi mage shii nawai è yang pha luthong pha ji è nawai shii asid yi rabo. Hì ne ji pha mua ro gu, Phaul, nyie yi zab sohjambling shii yua muii pha khiao ji ro.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phaul ne charch shii khiao duiine blia rek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Chiih-è thuh nathek chiang è diig rek pha ji ne sang ro, gu siu è diigthek rek pha miyao ne airo siu charch pha chiang shii Masi ro diigthek nyie yi led bamuii pha diigthek jijong yi pha gu ne nong ramuii ro. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Chiih-è nathek shii wie rek yi pha hanyie è hì pha blia gu shii phi. Gu ne Hamangkhung-aphuii chiang Charch shii khiao rab ne rai. Hì pha blia ne awairo mua shii zab yao pha ro. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Nyie yi buyo è zab pha bran è ug ne ruii pha ji ne jishii thuh ne awai bran shii dong phi. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii muphak ne rab pha ji ne airo ug pha ji awai bran shii thieg yi, nyie ai è awai bran shii bukho nane boh lubo ug pha ji ro, chiih-è ug pha ji ne hì ro Masi ne na shii um ro, nyie hì pha miyao ne nathek de Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biisiie ne thang ruii phro. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Ji-è gathek ne Masi ne zab shii yua. Zab pha khani rey mua pha ji è gathek ne phriie ne ithek shii yua nyieliieshii zab shii Hamangkhung-aphuii moe hà weg rey ne hanyie ne Masi rog ò rey mua. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Masi è phi pha riichaiboh chua nyie yi gu shii blia rek ramuii pha ji shii bokhoh ne hì pha blia shii jong yi pha gu è wiang nane diig rek.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Ji-è gu è nathek chiih-è Laodisea pha bran nane zab gai hanyie gu shii athieg ba pho chiang gu ne khama diig blia rek pha ji gu nathek shii yao riig. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Gu è ji rek phane ithek ne lububo rek ne miie shii ò rey yi pha rek phi, chiih-è izai ìd pha yao pha ji è yi khani thazang shii bajo bukho rey ruii, ji èrek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ug pha ji ìd mua, ug nyie yi Masi awai ro. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ug pha khani nane ìd pha thazang ji hong pha ziu ro.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Chiihphado, Gu nathek shii yao, ithek ne khama khie doh magunde hanyi è de nathek shii biidiie pha khnaing ji è khinrin arek yi rabo. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Chiih-è gu ne siu shii oi magungde, thuh de gu ne ragung shii ne nathek rog shii ro, chiih-è nathek ro migi ne Masi rog shii ò wie chuh rek pha ji riig ne gu ne sang ro.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi rog shii ley chai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Nathek è Masi Isu ne Ithong rone nyanuii shii, nathek ne ai rog shii ò rek ne rai bo. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Nathek iriingthek ne ai rog shii jam ruii bo, ai rog shii nathek chai ne rung bo, chiih-è nathek è yua pha duiine nawaithek migi shii gang rek ne rai bo. Chiih-è laso è ley ne rai bo.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Chiihphado, riig bo, hanyie è de bran ro adunmey pha khinrin pha khani è nathek shii khiao arab yi rabo, nyie yi Masi è asi pha jishii bran è yua pha nane hamangnyiak pha khohpho pha ragungthek è thog ro. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Masi siu shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro chai ne zab um ro. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Chiih-è nathek ne ai rog ò rek ne rai bone ley chai phijong ro. Ai ne zab pha luruak pha khohphothek nane riichai è khrug ba ro.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Masi rog shii ò rek pha ji è nathek de migiangkheg, nathek ne tharothamangthek è rab pha ji è Migiang-akheg ro, jishii Masi miirab ji è kheg, nyie yi gethek ro layog pha blu shii de ichad rek phi ro. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref></char></note>Chiih-è nathek è khowo yi shii, nathek shii de masi rog shii wiengjong, chiih è hanyie è aishii hòi din yi pha, Hamangkhung-aphuii blu khowo shii nathek ro migi è Masi rog hòi din ro. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Iphi 2:1-5</ref></char></note>Nathek ne luang jia ne ragung shii iy dun nyieliieshii nathek ro layog è chiih-è nyieliieshii nathek ne Iphey oi pha Gaibran ro. Jishii thuh Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek shii Masi rog chai yi phi. Hamangkhung-aphuii è gethek ro zab layog khungjong phi; <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Iphi 2:15</ref></char></note> ai è gethek ro anyu pha muruiithek sasab shii iphey è phang ne ruii pha ji shii thoh muii ne bai shii ziin muii pha chiang è zab ruang rek phi. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Chiih-è ji pha bai è Masi ne blu pha luruak khohphothek nane riichaithek è awai shii ichad rek ge; chiih-è zab pha moe ithek shii khiao rab ne airo yang pha lubo pha ji shii noh dun.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rom 14:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ji-è hanyie de nyie chie niing dinne gang inai dinne Iwo Habie sai dinne Jewthek thung pha inai chiang shii Iphey arab haro. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Zab jithek pha mana ne phariang ne ragia bie phro; chiih-è isbang ne Masi ro. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="COL 2:18-19"/>Nyieliieshii wie è miiramthek nane hanyie ne biidiie pha tharothamang rey ne chiih-è hamangkhliiethek shii sia ne nawaithek shii ne hanyie è boh rone yao pho è athe yi rabo. Zai branthek ne ithek ro tharothamang è now pha jihà ne wiangwe rek pha nane hanyie yi siu pha khrug rone Masi shii khoh pha ji ne thoh muii. Masi è phriie pha zab siu shii ran ne miak chiih-è rung pha ji è ò shii khoh dun, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è chid pha ji sieng dun.<verse eid="COL 2:18-19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi rog shii sieng pha nane iy pha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Nathek ne Masi rog shii iy ne hamangnyiak pha ragungthek khohthek pha ji è ichad rek phi. Nyie, chiihphado è nathek ne ichiih sohjambling è rey pha duiine rai habey? Nyie rek ne nathek ne ji è rek pha Iphey ji nuii phlei <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>“Ji akhoh rabo,” ji achai rabo, gai shii akhoh rabo? <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Zab hì pha mana ne ithek è khoh jishii adunmey pha mana rey dun ro hì pha mana chiang è yao ro. Ithek ne bran Iphey nane muyuathek ro. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Hamangkhliiethek shii sia pha bangchiie nane biidiie pha jum, chiih-è siu shii diigchiao phi pha hì thek zab ne khani ji è ipheythek shii khia, jishii ithek shii ne siu è chid pha ji shii phriie rek phane zai igong oi ro.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Chng 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nathek ne Masi rog shii chai hòijong, Ji-è nathek ro lubuthek ne hamangkhung pha manathek shii now mage bo, Khihà Masi ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biang pha phazoi shii dug muii ro. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Nathek ro khanithek ne ichiih sohnyiak pha ji shii asi pha, thiisa pha manathek shii isiie rek bo. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Chiih-è nathek iy dun pha ji è nathek ro chai ne Masi rog shii ug ne Hamangkhung-aphuii hà ro. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Nathek ro isbang chai ne Masi ro chiih-è ai dong mage shii, chiihphado nathek de ai rog shii dong ne airo biisiie ji thang ruii phro!<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chai ihèg nane iwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Chiihphado, nathek shii ne siulao, zea, awie pha now pha sohnyiak pha chid blia, awie yang pha, chiih-è giichak (chiih-è sgow ne jangbang ro) nathek shii blia rek pha ji shii ne ua muii bo. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Nyieliieshii jithek pha chiang ji è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro lijieg hanyie è aishii anuii pho shii thog ruii phro. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Ishak jia shii nathek ro chai ne jithek è dia muii shii, nathek ne nawaithek è chid pha ji shii sieng.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Jishii thuh nathek ne hì thek pha zab mana shii, lijieg, awie now, chiih-è khiijai pha than manathek jithek zab è ruang rai bo. Makhak-riing pha miyao dinne zea miyaothek nathek semthek è akhia rabo. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Iphi 4:22</ref></char></note>Nawaithek chung biidiie ayao rai rabo, nyieliieshii nathek ne ihèg lajia pha ji ne hongjong muii ro <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Iphi 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:26">Igo 1:26</ref></char></note>chiih-è nathek ne iwo ji guii bo. Hì ne iwo chai ro nyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii awai ne rab pho ro, chiih-è athodang pha iwo awai ro midong duiine rab lumao, nyieliieshii awairo ley khani nathek shii rey yie pha rek. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Ji è rey pha chiang shii, Gaibranthek nane Jewthek duchoi migiangkheg pha nane migiang-akheg pho duchoi shii dinne jabiingpho duiine miishiiypho, khiao chiih-è ichad pho chung ne nyie yoh oi ro, jishii zab ne Masi ro, Masi ne zab shii um ro.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12,13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:2">Iphi 4:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bran ro; ai è nathek shii miie chiih-è awairo rone nathek shii gua. Ji-è chiihphado, nathek ne bushun, jum, isiie, mieng, nane zud pha yung guii bo. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Nawaithek chung zud rai bo chiih-è nathek gai gidieg yao rai mage shii khung phi rai bo. Nathek ne Ithong è khung phi pha duiine nawaithek chung de khung rai bo. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Chiih-è hìthek shiine miie pha ji shii lao bo, nyie ne zab shii khriig ò jia hà phang ne ruii phi phro. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Hìpha liijiing ne nathek phak shii gayiig rek phi pha Masi è phi ro; chiih-è hìne jipha liijiing ro Hamangkhung-aphuii è siu jia shii ò jia rek pha ho. Chiih-è laso phi bo. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16,17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Iphi 5:19</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:20">20</ref></char></note>Masi ro mua ne zab nathek shii lubuthek hà um bo. Nawaithek chung zab khani rog shii yua ne yung rai bo. Sthun bai ne, ibai bai ne, so ibaithek bai ne; Hamangkhung-aphuii shii nawaithek lubu è ibai bai ne laso phi bo. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Chiihphado, nathek ne zab rek ne yao bo, Ithong Isu ibeng è zab rek ro, chiih-è nathek ne ai chiang è Hamangkhung-aphuii Aphuii shii laso phi bo.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chai iwo shii hanyiehanyie siangthangthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Iphi 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Phth 3:1</ref></char>
    </note>Yiy nawaithek ne nawaithek geythek shii phi muii bo, chiih-è nathek Masiphothek è nyie rek pha ji duiine rek bo.<verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Iphi 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Phth 3:7</ref></char>
    </note>Geythek, nawaithek yiy shii miie bo chiih-è ithek shii buii arek rabo.<verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:1">Iphi 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aniphiing, idang nawaithek aphuii-amuiithek shii nuii pha hì ne nathek ro Masipho pha blia ro, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è sang pha chiang ji ne hì ro.<verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:4">Iphi 6:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aphuii-amuiithek, Nawaithek aniphiing shii alijieg yi rabo, asi shii ne ithek lubu ìu rey mage phro.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Iphi 6:5-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Khiaothek, zab shii ne nawaithek ro muspho shii nuii bo, nathek ne ithek è nathek shii riig mage shii nathek ne rek chak rone doh yi pha arek bie rabo; jishii nawaithek lubu rog shii rek bo nyieliieshii nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii ilab rek phi. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Nathek nyie blia rek magungde, nathek ne bran blia rek pha asi pha Ithong ro blia rek pha duiine nawaithek lubu rog shii rek bo. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Now bo Ithong è awai bran shii nyie ruii phi pha ji ne nathek ne mua ruii phro. Chiih-è nathek è blia rek pha Masi ne isbang Muspho ro. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Iphy 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Iphi 6:9</ref></char></note>Chiih-è nyie awie pha blia rek arone aishii ji duiine phi din ruii phro, nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab bran shii ò è chua ruii phro.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Iphi 6:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Musphothek, nawaithek khiaothek shii khui shii wie nane khriig rek bo, Now bo nathek shii de hamangkhung hà Muspho um ro.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuathek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Misia shii chuh rek bo, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii laso phi pha nawaithek misia shii nowbthan bo. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Ji-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è gu shii ne Masi pha ug pha airo mua ji yua mua wie chua phi yi pha ji pha ishak shii gathek shii de sia phi bo. Ji è gu ne phatheg shii ro. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Chiihphado, gu ne khi-èrek hì duiine sang è yao mua shii sia mage bo.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:16">Iphi 5:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nathek shii um pha zab jo shii ne wie khoh pha rab ne hanyie yi migipho asi pho shii blia rek shii khua è rek bo. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Nathek miyao ne idang sang pha nane nyu yang yie bo, chiih-è ithek zab shii khi-èrek ne izai chang chid pha ji ne nathek ìd bo.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha salamthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Blk 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Thi 4:12</ref></char>
    </note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7,8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21">Iphi 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref></char></note>Gathek ro wie ijak Thychikhus, hanyie yi Ithong blia shii nane migi shii bliapho è, nathek shii gu chiang zab mua phi ruii phro. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Ji è gathek zab ne khi-èrek ne um lei ne ji pha chiang nathek nuii ne sang yi pha, gu ne aishii nathek hà thoh ge ro. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Phlm 10-12</ref></char></note>Ai rog shii Onesimus de wuii dun, ji ne bushun nane isiie ijak ro, hanyie yi nathek ibrog è ro. Ichiih shii nyie re ramuii pha ji ne ithek è nathek shii yao ruii phro.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Blk 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phlm 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Blk 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char>
    </note>Aristarchus, hanyie yi gu rog shii phatheg hà ro, nathek shii salamthek phi ro, chiih-è Marg è de rek ro, hanyie yi Barnabas ro khuiino ro. (Ai è nathek lumuii shii wuii arone nathek ne Marg shii wie ho pha muyuathek ne mua jong.) <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Joshua shii, Justhus de ho, nathek shii bajo salamthek thoh ge. Jithek um ne hanyie è gu rog shii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Sajathua pha blia rek pha Jewthek migiphothek bie ro, chiih-è ithek ne gu shii bajo nong phi ro.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Khol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Phlm 23</ref></char>
    </note>Ephaphras è, nathek ibrog pha gai branthek nane Masi Isu ro khiao è de salam phi ro. Ai ne idang nathek chiang shii athodang pha sia phi ro, nathek shii chuh rek phi bone Hamangkhung-aphuii shii lia phi ro, chiih-è Masiphothek shii ne weg rey ne ley gayiig yi pha, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii miiyang ji shii zab nuii yi pha rek phi ro. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Gu ne nathek chiang nane Laodisea pha bran shii nane Hierapholis shii airo snag blia ji gui è khagi nyarek mua. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Thi 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phlm 24</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Thi 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phlm 24</ref></char></note>Lug, gethek ro bushun pha mapho nane Demas è de salamthek yao ne ren ge ro.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Gathek ro zab è wie salam ji ne Laodisea pha charch pha migiphothek shii chiih-è Nympha nane Charch ai è airo hò shii si muii pha ji shii de phi bo. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Nathek hì pha jigigam tham ched pha idoh, Laodisea pha Charch pha migiphothek shii de tham yi bo. Ji pha ishak ò shii, Gu è thoh ge pha jigigam ji ne Laodisea pha migiphothek è na shii thoh ge shii na ne tham bo. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Phlm 2</ref></char></note>Chiih-è Archiphus shii yao bo, na shii Ithong è blia phi pha ji ne jong pha rek bo.<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Hì ne gui wad mizey ro: Phaul re-è salamthek thoh ge ro. Guro shiirnaithek shii abileng rabo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne nathek rog shii um bo.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
